{"version":1,"key":"card:752","content":{"id":752,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在计算两点距离或向量模长时，手动用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Math.sqrt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 写平方和容易遇到数值溢出的问题，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Math.hypot","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是为此而生的，它计算所有参数平方和的平方根。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Math.hypot(value1, value2, /* …, */ valueN)","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2650bc93-9861-4cff-a78d-e84301f89eda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\text{Math.hypot}(v_1, v_2, \\cdots, v_n) = \\sqrt{\\sum_{i}^{n}v_i^2}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的用途是计算二维、三维空间的距离，或者向量的模。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 二维两个点的距离\nfunction distance(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n  return Math.hypot(x2 - x1, y2 - y1);\n}\n\ndistance(0, 0, 3, 4); // 5","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f1ea9fac-4f65-4ea7-8ced-fa4bc7d151af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比直接使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Math.sqrt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 手动计算，它的优势在于："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防溢出，内部处理了极大值和极小值"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const big = 1e200;\n\n// 手动计算 — 中间值溢出为 Infinity\nMath.sqrt(big * big + big * big); // Infinity ❌\n\n// Math.hypot — 正确处理\nMath.hypot(big, big); // 1.4142135623730951e+200 ✅","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6b5fea52-3d35-4bbe-9c24-93d94e81ce18","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"高精度，更好的数值稳定性"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const x = 1e-300;\nconst y = 1e-300;\n\nMath.hypot(x, y);          // 1.4142135623730952e-300（正确）✅\nMath.sqrt(x*x + y*y);      // 0 ❌（x*x 下溢为 0）","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2defb2b6-c68d-4ecd-a0bd-2dcc8550a536","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外它对特殊值也有明确的处理规则："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Math.hypot(Infinity, NaN);  // Infinity（只要有一个 Infinity 就返回 Infinity）\nMath.hypot(NaN, 3);         // NaN（含 NaN 且无 Infinity 时返回 NaN）\nMath.hypot();               // 0\nMath.hypot(0);              // 0","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0ee780f6-3c64-4682-9b5e-23ff63c763b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Math"],"createTime":1780617927317,"updateTime":1780618843929,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1780618843929}}